	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We've returned!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Soujin-kun, my boy! You're truly a man among men!”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"After school on Wednesday.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"When I arrive at the shop, the manager proffers me a single rose.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the meaning of this?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“A celebration. Please, do accept it.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What am I supposed to do with a flower?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“This coming from a guy who works at a flower shop...”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The manager deftly trims the stem and sticks it in my hair.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's a nice look.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gee, thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I pluck the flower off my head and place it in my lapel pocket.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“We just received an order from the Imperial Palace. ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"The",
{"/font"},
" Imperial Palace!”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Along with a memo of thanks to one Sir Tokita for services rendered.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You could've knocked me over with a feather!”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I was so shocked, I accidentally told them we don't know of any Tokitas. Hahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Er, that's a problem.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'm kidding, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Akari and I both let out a sigh.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So, what kind of order was it?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Twenty pots of forget-me-nots. They're leaving the finer details to us.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Forget-me-nots? What sort of flowers are those?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're these lovely blue blossoms right around this time of year. Most befitting of Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, lovely, are they? Good to know.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't be jealous.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm not, thank you very much.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“In any case, Soujin-kun, you'll need to pay these folks a visit.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The manager hands me a slip of paper with the name and contact information of a horticulturist.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seishu? That's over three hours from here by car.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Their forget-me-nots are the finest the Empire has to offer.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“And they won't be coming to market tomorrow, so I want you to go buy them in person right now.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Right now?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's an order from the Imperial Palace, after all. We have to deliver them first thing tomorrow morning, whatever it takes.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“And the finest ones in all the Empire at that.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“In the name of Koujiya Flowers, I refuse to deliver an inferior product.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"I reach out to clasp the manager's outstretched hand.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'm counting on you, Soujin-kun!”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Leave it to me.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Long live Empress Hisui!”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Long─”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"I feel a needle-like glare boring into the back of my head.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Got a problem? Go on, say it.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Long trip, it'll be... We'll have to eat on the road.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Thought so.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Welcome.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Good evening.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Soujin isn't at his usual seat.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Where's everyone?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“They received an important order at the shop, so I do not believe they will be joining us tonight.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh...”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Sitting alone at the bar, the seats feel strangely big.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It's been rather lonely lately, has it not?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"She serves an udo salad with vinegar and miso dressing.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He can't help it if he's that busy.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And besides, Soujin has his own path to walk.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hehee, I never said I was talking about Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"As I chew the udo, a slight bitter taste spreads across my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Ever since Miyaguni showed up, our dinner times just\nhaven't matched up.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"It would be easy to call in advance and arrange a time to eat together, but I'd just be a nuisance if I bothered him every day with such trivial matters.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's fine if we both just eat whenever is convenient for us.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed, I believe so as well.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"I think one thing but say another. Even though she probably saw right through me, Mutsumi is kind enough to go along with it.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mutsumi, haven't you thought about coming back to the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“That is quite the sudden question.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I've already dispensed with the blade. It is no longer my place to stand on the battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Mutsumi answers without breaking her faint smile.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But! As soon as you come back, I'm sure all the others who hung up their blades will─”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"She chides me with a gentle yet firm voice.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Sorry...”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Mutsumi and the other warriors knew what they were doing when they hung up their blades.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Indeed, making the decision to abandon the fight is perhaps even more difficult than just continuing on.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"It was an ill-considered overture, nothing more than an attempt to allay my own loneliness.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I can't afford to be this weak-willed.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If I keep acting like this, it'll be bad for morale.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"I clap myself on the cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Have you ever wondered why springtime cuisine includes so many bitter ingredients?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“In other seasons, it is customary to dispense with these bitter tastes, but not so during spring.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“'Tis surely the season to embrace all that which comes with such bitterness.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Mutsumi says with a kindly smile, as she fries up some seasonal vegetables.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Eight of the clock next morning.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"The manager sees us off, and we head for the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"In the loading bed of the van are the flower pots that the manager spent all of last night arranging after I bought them.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's start by going over today's objectives.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Deliver these splendid forget-me-nots to the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's objective number one.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Objective number two is...”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sneak into the Imperial Palace and confirm the location of the Three Sacred Treasures.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And number three?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Number three? I don't remember anything about three.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Make it back home in one piece.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, that goes without saying.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Akari says with a shrug of her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"We pass the Republic occupation's inspection checkpoint and arrive at the outer gates of the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"The palace is protected by Okonogi's two thousand-strong Forbidden Guard.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Our spies in the Sworn Blades haven't even been able to infiltrate the palace, so our intel is highly limited.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Any observations I can gather about the state of their security will be useful for us in the future.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koujiya Flowers. We've come to deliver an order.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"After stating our business at the gate, the guard prompts us to disembark from the van.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"He's going to lead us on foot the rest of the way.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I leave the van outside the gate and transfer the flowers to a pushcart.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"We fall in behind the guard and make for the palace.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"At the top of the stone steps, we're greeted by columns of the Forbidden Guard flanking us on both sides.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"There must be over five hundred of them.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"They stand at attention, arms ported, as though receiving an esteemed foreign dignitary.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I wasn't expecting such a warm welcome.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, it's crazy.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Looks like Okonogi's totally seen through who we are.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"A cold sweat trickles down my spine.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Ours might very well be a one-way trip if we proceed any further.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's still not too late to turn back.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He went to all the trouble of rolling out the red carpet just for us. Let's see what he's got.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Akari boldly strides forward, practically basking in all the attention directed towards her.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Passing by the rows of saluting soldiers, we follow our escort and proceed onward.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"We enter the main palace building and make our way down a wide corridor.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Guards are stationed at regular intervals, throwing sharp gazes our way as we pass by.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"There are watchposts overlooking every courtyard, each one bristling with steely-eyed sentries glaring down at us.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"On top of that, the palace is probably bristling with alarms and bulkheads powered by magicks that I haven't even noticed.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Security is far tighter than I'd ever imagined.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"I'd thought we could successfully take the Imperial Palace if we just had enough spellblades, but I'll need to revise that opinion.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Finally, we arrive at a spacious hall.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"I pass the flowers over to an attendant, and our escort dutifully bows to us before withdrawing.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"It seems like this is our destination.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"The audience chamber, by the look of things.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"The faint and fragrant aroma of incense drifts in from places unknown.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Even though the sun is shining brightly outside, its light does not penetrate this tenebrous expanse of vermilion pillars.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"It feels as though the Empire's entire two thousand years of history slumber within these shadows, and I unwittingly stand up a little straighter.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“How do you find the Imperial Palace after such a long absence, Your Highness?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"A weighty voice descends upon us.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"I look towards the dais and find a familiar man sitting upon the throne.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Step down from the throne at once.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That is no place for a mere vassal to sit.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I'm getting on in years, and standing for long wears terribly on this body. Why not grant me this?”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"With a chuckle, Okonogi taps his fingers on the end of the armrest.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi!”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"I grab Akari's arm before she rushes him head-on.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The throne's surroundings are not as they seem.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Impressive, warrior. You have a good eye.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The throne is protected by a barrier of magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“One must protect oneself from impetuous rabble the likes of Her Highness, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're more of a coward than I took you for.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I would have thought you'd be a bit more audacious, considering what you did to Mother.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Hahahaha, I prefer the word 'cautious' myself.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Well, given that Your Highness has come all this way, shall we have ourselves a nice, long chat?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Okonogi casually leans against the back of the throne and crosses his legs.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Akari lowers her raised fist in turn.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That was an awfully warm reception you laid out just now.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How long have you been monitoring us?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Ever since the day Your Highness attacked me.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Surely Your Highness could not have seriously expected to evade my notice? Even arrogance ought have its limits.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Keep underestimating us like that, and that'll be the last mistake you ever make.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“A fine proposition.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Indeed, I could certainly afford some more tension in my life.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"He reclines even further back into the throne.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I am beset by such tedium, you see. These days of ennui bore me to no end.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“For this reason alone, I've permitted you to roam free all this time despite knowing your whereabouts.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“And now, here before me stands the dregs of that foolish\nEmpress's legacy, come for revenge with but a single vassal in tow!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“No jester in all the realm could have brought me such mirth!”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Akari steps in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You dare mock my mother after spending all these years eating from the Imperial Family's hand?!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Ah, yes! Yes, there it is! That there is the very thing!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Okonogi raises his scepter and points it straight at Akari.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I could never betray them because I've faithfully served for many years. I must never betray them because I accepted their benevolence.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It is precisely that sort of blighted, outdated thinking which made me turn against the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The Imperial Family sits complacently within a palace of constructs devised purely for their own convenience, blind to the wider world around them.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Okonogi rises from the throne.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"I rush to interpose myself between him and Akari.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Stand down.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Worry not. I have no intention of bringing harm to Her Highness. When we are finished here, I shall permit you to withdraw unharmed.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Okonogi states without even looking at me.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Time and again, I unfailingly sought to impress upon Empress Suou the grave threat that the Republic posed.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“And yet... And yet, not once would she deign to lend me her ear.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“There is no precedent! Our relations remain amicable! Now is not yet the time! ...Nothing but excuses.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“And so, I turned my back on Empress Suou.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I decided to serve a new master, one that saw the true value in me: the Republic.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How preposterous!”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Republic doesn't give a damn about you. They were just after the country you served to them on a silver platter!”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Empress Suou reviled me in much the same way.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Truly nothing more than the pitiful laments of the vanquished. It's too late. Far too late for such words to matter.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Indeed, when she finally realized, she said to me, 'Vile traitor, I shall put you down myself!'”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“How can I help but laugh at such profound folly?”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Curse you, Okonogi!”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Hahaha, hahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“For deigning to pay me this visit, shall I impart Your Highness with the late Empress's last words?”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“'Curse you, Okonogi.'”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Like mother, like daughter, it would seem. Hehehe, ahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Akari's hands are clenched tightly enough to cause them to tremble.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Glowering with indignation, her glare threatens to shatter the Spellshield into pieces.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Hahahahaha, every bit as hysterical as your mother was, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Blind to the bigger picture. Allowing your emotions to dictate your actions. One of such temperament is utterly unfit to be Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The bigger picture?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If selling out my own country is part of some bigger picture, I don't want any part of it!”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“You wound me. I am acting in the best interests of the Empire, make no mistake.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"With this utterance, Okonogi slightly curves the edges of his lips.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Big words for the cur who sold out his own countrymen!”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I'm afraid I do not consider any Imperial to be a countryman of mine.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"At this, Akari's expression takes on a dangerous glint.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The people of the Empire are imbeciles.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“The Empress single-handedly lost them the war, yet they still continue to sing the praises of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“What's more, they're none the wiser to its crown jewel getting switched out right under their noses.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“And if that wasn't enough, they even stone the warriors as war criminals.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Utterly irredeemable human refuse. The whole lot of them.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“And if that is all they amount to, I would gladly burn this Empire to the ground, that its ashes might─”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Silence!”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Akari's furious outburst blows away Okonogi's smirk.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"It's enough to make my hair stand on end.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The only human refuse here is you, Okonogi Tokihiko!”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A statesman lives only to serve her subjects. The likes of you, one who preys on his own people, has no right to lay claim to such a noble title!”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Trite platitudes.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ours is to remain untarnished, even unto death, that even these platitudes can become truth!”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Heh, hehehe... How ridiculous.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"Akari gallantly steps forward.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Her imposing stature, radiating a noble majesty, is truly a sight to behold.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We of the Imperial Family have been entrusted with the Empire by Oomikami Himself.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We have a sacred duty to protect the land's harvests and the country's peace in His stead.”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Oh?”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As the last survivor of the Imperial Family, I swear that I will drag you down from the chancellery, even at the cost of my life!”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Akari's sonorous voice reverberates throughout this hallowed hall.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"Her words to Okonogi are as an Imperial decree from all the collective Emperors of ages past.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Her amaranthine gaze shines with lucidity, lacking even the barest hint of affectation.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"And yet, the royal blood coursing through her veins enshrouds her with an aura of inviolable divinity.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Akari is unquestionably the genuine article.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"How foolish to think that we ever needed the Three Sacred Treasures...",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"Would that they could see her now, every last living being in the realm would unquestionably recognize her claim as the true Imperial Princess.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Yes, yes! That's the spirit now.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Do try your best to amuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Akari returns Okonogi's hideous smirk with a serene gaze of her own.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's be off, Soujin. I have nothing else to say.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Akari calmly turns on her heel and begins to depart.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Her receding silhouette looms larger than life, enough to make me forget for a moment that I'm the one meant to protect her.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"Yet at the same time, I've never felt prouder to serve.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"─You alone are my lord. You and none other.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"My heart sings with this conviction.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"And with every beat, it fills me up with an indescribable sense of being made whole again.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Let me leave you with a piece of interesting news.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Okonogi's voice follows us from behind.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"But Akari and I don't even break our stride.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"About ten minutes later, we climb back into the van.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"Just as Okonogi said, the guards let us walk right on out.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin, can we spare some time to visit my mother's grave?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I want to give her an update on things.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course we can.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"We arrive at the Imperial Tomb, surrounded by the fresh scent of budding flowers.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"The peach blossoms may have arrived late this year, but spring is undoubtedly upon us.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mmmmm, what a nice feeling!”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"At a spot overlooking the streets of Tenkyo, Akari lets out a big stretch.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"The sky is clear as can be.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"The last time we came here, the sky was still overcast with clouds of gloom.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"Akari and I jauntily proceed to Empress Suou's grave.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Plenty of flowers here again today.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're the proof of Empress Suou's virtue.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"There have always been flowers offered in front of Empress Suou's grave whenever I come here.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"She is revered by the people as a proud Empress who atoned for losing the war with her life.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Even though in reality, she was murdered by Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"Akari wordlessly offers a prayer before the grave.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"A devout prayer that stretches on and on.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"As her attendant, I take a few steps back and pay my own respects.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mother...”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Today, I met Okonogi and found my resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"Akari breaks her silence with a solemn proclamation.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I swear that I shall strike Okonogi down and restore order to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“May you continue to watch over me.”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"The words that come out of Akari's mouth are the pledge\nI've always wanted to hear.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"Akari finally unclasps her hands and turns to face me.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“From this point on, I intend to live for the sake of our people as the last survivor of the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well then, have you given up on your assassination plot?”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Everything you said was right. Killing that man won't be enough to change the country.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We can only remake society through a righteous struggle.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"So she's finally accepted it.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Besides, it's not enough if all his crimes are absolved by simply dying.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He deserves to be judged before the people for his high crimes against the country.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"As though glaring at Okonogi himself, Akari directs her gaze at the Imperial Palace far in the distance.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"It's a gaze that conveys the full extent of her furor.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aww, guess this means I lost.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Lost what?”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I gave up on assassinating Okonogi by the day we agreed on, right? You win this time.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"I remember what I said on the day Akari tried to kill him.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"By the anniversary of the end of the war, March 20th, I would make her give up on Okonogi's assassination.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“From the bottom of my heart, I am pleased by your wise decision.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you remember what you promised me back then?”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You said if I gave up on the assassination, you'd wholeheartedly pledge your fealty to me. Am I wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course I remember.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Very good! That's what I wanna hear!”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"Akari pompously puts her hands on her hips.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Just kidding.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"She shows me a carefree smile.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, thanks for sticking by me all this time.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To redress his lord's imprudence is but a vassal's duty.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"Akari would usually bare her fangs at this sort of provocation, but this time, she receives it with a smile.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, that's wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I was the one who was mistaken to think that you lacked in wisdom.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You were merely living under a different value system that I could hardly even imagine.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We warriors offer our very lives to our lords.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But those of the Imperial Family also put their own lives on the line, all for the sake of justly ruling over the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"“If one fails to safeguard the land and breaks the covenant with Oomikami, one must offer their life in atonement.”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"With this creed drilled into her head since birth, this girl sought only to lay down her own life as penance for our defeat in the war.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"Any ordinary person would see that as a meaningless death.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"But such is the pride of the Imperial Family that has reigned over our Empire for two thousand years.",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"Armed only with his wicked and worldly values, Okonogi could never possibly live up to the nobility of the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"As statesmen, they are utterly unalike in dignity.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sure Mother will forgive me for making this decision.”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The people, too.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There are none who would begrudge you for standing and fighting for the restoration of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I hope you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"With a grin, Akari peers down once again at the city below.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"The spring wind, ripe with the scent of budding blossoms, sets her gorgeous hair aflutter.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We shall surely restore order to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That the people may once again live their lives in peace.”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"Akari has finally turned her gaze toward the distant future.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			{
"More than simply relief, I can also feel a great vitality surging up within me.",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			{
"I swear to see her in her rightful place on the Imperial Throne.",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"And I swear to return the Empire to its former glory.",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			{
"We head back into the city.",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"Sitting behind the wheel, I ruminate on our conversation with Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you think Okonogi actually realized the threat the Republic posed?”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He totally made that up after the fact. He's just trying to rationalize what he did.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I hope you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If Okonogi destroyed the Barrier and let the Republican Army in, then the Empire was done in from within.”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So ended 'the realm under God's protection,' huh?”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I hate to say it, but it's the Imperial Family's duty to keep its own retainers in line.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If we gave Okonogi too much authority, then that is our mistake to bear.”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And assuming it really was my mother's folly, then it's my duty as her daughter to set things right.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"Akari whispers with an expression of contrition.",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whatever the case, we just have to take the Empire back from Okonogi.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And after that, expel the Republicans.”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"I swerve to avoid a military vehicle jutting out from the opposite lane.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But you know, it wasn't a waste of time to talk to him.”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"Akari takes out her cell phone.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I secretly recorded everything Okonogi said!”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Really?!”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That stupid idiot. He basically confessed all his crimes then and there.”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"Akari plays back the recording.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			{
"Okonogi's voice resounds clearly throughout the van.",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do I really sound like that? That's kinda embarrassing.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When you normally hear your own voice, it sounds different because it's echoing through your─”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Spare me the trivia lecture...”",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, hold on! Listen to this part.”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"Akari stops the playback.",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you think there's another big use for this recording?”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi called me 'Your Highness,' didn't he?”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This here is irrefutable proof of my lineage!”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're absolutely right.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's like everything's falling right into place for us.”",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			{
"Akari eagerly faces forward with renewed spirits.",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"Even Hotori won't be able to refute Okonogi's unwitting testimony and the Exalt-Priestess's appraisal of Akari's Artifact.",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"And once we win her over, we'll have the entire Sworn Blades on our side.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh yeah, I've got a favor to ask you.”",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your wish is my command.”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In preparation for what's to come, can you teach me the basics of the blade?”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't mind, but why?”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It doesn't hurt to have a lord who can hold her own in a fight, does it?”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			{
"Akari's face shines with excitement.",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			{
"That effervescent smile infects me with her motivation.",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then let's start tomorrow morning. Don't overdo it, though.”",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Looking forward to it, Sensei.”",
			},
